WEBVTT

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:01.810
And we saw the country’s hope
being fulfilled right in front of us.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.460
I can never forget that moment.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:06.960
I was a simple girl from Lucknow,

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.970
who was curious to know about outer space

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:13.470
and who got a chance to be associated 
with the Mars Mission.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:15.560
With the success of the Mars mission,

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:19.900
1.3 billion Indians proved to the world

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:23.680
that we have the capability 
to go this far into outer space

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.690
and that we are as competent 
as anybody out there.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:31.670
(Applause)